module test.claim.field_default_declaring_scope_carrier

// THE ARM POPULATION THE DECLARING MODULE DOES NOT OWN.
//
// `FieldDefaultCarrierAck` is the arm the fixture (`test.claim.field_default_declaring_scope_fixture`)
// reaches in a parameter default through a NAMED IMPORT rather than through its own declarations. It is
// the second half of the moved population: a default read that the declaring site can name because its
// own file imports the name, which the caller still cannot see. Without it, a fix could bind only the
// declaring module's own arms and pass every other claim in this file set while leaving the imported-arm
// shape — and any future `= SomeOtherModule'sArm` default — to the caller's environment.
type FieldDefaultCarrierToken
  = FieldDefaultCarrierAck
  | FieldDefaultCarrierNack
